# 8.30 Preparation Strategy — We Should **Not Implement Everything**

Yes — **we are going in the right direction**, but I would change the strategy slightly now that we've covered enough of the project to see the pattern.

Your instinct is correct:

> **First get the concepts and interview answers covered quickly → then do targeted coding/implementation drills → finally refactor the payment project and do mock interview scenarios.**

Trying to implement every concept in the project would actually be a bad use of your remaining time.

---

