# So our rule from now on

I want us to use this:

### 🟢 IMPLEMENT

If the interviewer is likely to ask you to actually write it.

Examples:

```text
CompletableFuture
Executor
Thread-safe code
ConcurrentHashMap
LRU
Kafka producer/consumer concepts
SQL
Spring REST
Validation
JWT/security flow
```

### 🟡 UNDERSTAND + SMALL EXAMPLE

If implementation isn't worth spending significant time on.

Examples:

```text
Circuit breaker internals
Kafka replication internals
Mongo internals
OAuth internals
Spring internals
```

### 🔵 THEORY + INTERVIEW ANSWER

If it's primarily conceptual.

Examples:

```text
CAP theorem
ACID
exactly-once semantics
hexagonal architecture
consistency models
trade-offs
```

Then we **integrate the important pieces into the payment project at the end**.

